herdr-panel-wrap

mods/files-wrap and mods/changes-wrap are modified copies of the `files` and
`changes` mods shipped with Herdr app 0.1.11
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, defaults/mods/), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes: long lines wrap instead of scrolling sideways, as proposed by
samitooooo in https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app/pull/248. Each changed
file says so in its first lines.
